abstract: "A benchmark for verifying claims about arms-control treaty participation against yearly UNODA status records, with lexical baselines, a fine-tuned cross-encoder, zero-shot NLI and a multi-agent LLM pipeline with provenance checks and abstention."
keywords: [fact verification, arms control, agentic AI, retrieval, natural language inference, abstention]
